# GSD adapter

Global `/gsd/*` is optional planning. This repo’s source of truth is `docs/requirements/` + the tracker.

- One GSD phase = one requirement slug (`01-tenancy` … `42-admin-platform-settings`). Do not invent module slugs.
- Execute with skill `implement-module` (Ponytail → TDD → Stitch → shadcn/`shared-ui` → `verify-gates`).
- Status lives in `docs/requirements/AGENT-REQUIREMENT-IMPLEMENTATION.md`, not only `.planning/STATE.md`.
- Follow ADRs, boundaries, e2e-kit, and 100% Vitest coverage. Do not skip Stitch for UI.
- Do not duplicate GSD command files into this repo. See skill `gsd-namma-adapter`.
